{"type":"message","id":"8390a888","parentId":"f558b742","timestamp":"2026-03-13T17:26:56.982Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"exec:23","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"105:      \"aily:file:read\",\n106:      \"aily:file:write\",\n113:      \"corehr:file:download\",\n121:      \"im:message:send_as_bot\",\n124:    \"user\": [\"aily:file:read\", \"aily:file:write\", \"im:chat.access_event.bot_p2p_chat:read\"]\n174:### Configure via config file\n241:- `resolveSenderNames` (default `true`): when `false`, skip sender profile lookup calls.\n276:In Feishu, find your bot and send a message.\n371:### Restrict which senders can message in a group (sender allowlist)\n373:In addition to allowing the group itself, **all messages** in that group are gated by the sender open_id: only users listed in `groups.<chat_id>.allowFrom` have their messages processed; messages from other members are ignored (this is full sender-level gating, not only for control commands like /reset or /new).\n474:### Message send failures\n476:1. Ensure the app has `im:message:send_as_bot` permission\n531:Set `streaming: false` to wait for the full reply before sending."}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":14,"aggregated":"105:      \"aily:file:read\",\n106:      \"aily:file:write\",\n113:      \"corehr:file:download\",\n121:      \"im:message:send_as_bot\",\n124:    \"user\": [\"aily:file:read\", \"aily:file:write\", \"im:chat.access_event.bot_p2p_chat:read\"]\n174:### Configure via config file\n241:- `resolveSenderNames` (default `true`): when `false`, skip sender profile lookup calls.\n276:In Feishu, find your bot and send a message.\n371:### Restrict which senders can message in a group (sender allowlist)\n373:In addition to allowing the group itself, **all messages** in that group are gated by the sender open_id: only users listed in `groups.<chat_id>.allowFrom` have their messages processed; messages from other members are ignored (this is full sender-level gating, not only for control commands like /reset or /new).\n474:### Message send failures\n476:1. Ensure the app has `im:message:send_as_bot` permission\n531:Set `streaming: false` to wait for the full reply before sending.","cwd":"/home/yankeeting/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1773422816977}}
{"type":"message","id":"1fa48843","parentId":"8390a888","timestamp":"2026-03-13T17:27:00.938Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"让我查看一下 OpenClaw 消息格式的详细文档，看看文件发送的正确格式是什么："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"read:24","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/usr/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/start/openclaw.md","offset":180,"limit":30}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volces-com","model":"ark-code-latest","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773422816981}}
{"type":"message","id":"ff610e38","parentId":"1fa48843","timestamp":"2026-03-13T17:27:00.947Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"read:24","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Inbound attachments (images/audio/docs) can be surfaced to your command via templates:\n\n- `{{MediaPath}}` (local temp file path)\n- `{{MediaUrl}}` (pseudo-URL)\n- `{{Transcript}}` (if audio transcription is enabled)\n\nOutbound attachments from the agent: include `MEDIA:<path-or-url>` on its own line (no spaces). Example:\n\n```\nHere’s the screenshot.\nMEDIA:https://example.com/screenshot.png\n```\n\nOpenClaw extracts these and sends them as media alongside the text.\n\n## Operations checklist\n\n```bash\nopenclaw status          # local status (creds, sessions, queued events)\nopenclaw status --all    # full diagnosis (read-only, pasteable)\nopenclaw status --deep   # adds gateway health probes (Telegram + Discord)\nopenclaw health --json   # gateway health snapshot (WS)\n```\n\nLogs live under `/tmp/openclaw/` (default: `openclaw-YYYY-MM-DD.log`).\n\n## Next steps\n\n- WebChat: [WebChat](/web/webchat)\n- Gateway ops: [Gateway runbook](/gateway)\n\n[8 more lines in file. Use offset=210 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773422820943}}
{"type":"message","id":"ca175f2e","parentId":"ff610e38","timestamp":"2026-03-13T17:27:11.893Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"太好了！我找到了正确的格式：\n\n> **Outbound attachments from the agent: include `MEDIA:<path-or-url>` on its own line (no spaces). Example:**\n> \n> ```\n> Here's the screenshot.\n> MEDIA:https://example.com/screenshot.png\n> ```\n\n所以正确的格式确实是 `MEDIA:` 前缀，而且必须单独一行，不能有空格。\n\n但是你说没有收到消息，这说明可能：\n1. 路径有问题\n2. 文件不存在或无法访问\n3. 飞书 API 有问题\n\n让我确认一下文件确实存在并且路径正确："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"exec:25","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"ls -la /home/yankeeting/DailyReports/doc/2026-03-13-日报.txt /home/yankeeting/DailyReports/md/2026-03-13-日报.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volces-com","model":"ark-code-latest","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773422820946}}
