{"type":"message","id":"9ca53a5a","parentId":"8dc96445","timestamp":"2026-03-13T17:27:41.501Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"exec:28","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"/usr/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/start/openclaw.md:186:Outbound attachments from the agent: include `MEDIA:<path-or-url>` on its own line (no spaces). Example:\n/usr/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/start/openclaw.md:190:MEDIA:https://example.com/screenshot.png\n/usr/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/tools/index.md:300:- `screenshot` (returns image block + `MEDIA:<path>`)\n/usr/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/tools/index.md:338:- `snapshot` (returns image block + `MEDIA:<path>`)\n/usr/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/tools/index.md:365:- Images return image blocks + `MEDIA:<path>`.\n/usr/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/tools/browser.md:530:  - `--labels` adds a viewport-only screenshot with overlayed ref labels (prints `MEDIA:<path>`).\n/usr/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/tools/agent-send.md:24:  - default: prints reply text (plus `MEDIA:<url>` lines)\n/usr/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/start/openclaw.md:218:来自智能体的出站附件：在单独一行包含 `MEDIA:<path-or-url>`（无空格）。示例：\n/usr/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/start/openclaw.md:222:MEDIA:https://example.com/screenshot.png\n/usr/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/tools/index.md:275:- `screenshot`（返回图像块 + `MEDIA:<path>`）"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":37,"aggregated":"/usr/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/start/openclaw.md:186:Outbound attachments from the agent: include `MEDIA:<path-or-url>` on its own line (no spaces). Example:\n/usr/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/start/openclaw.md:190:MEDIA:https://example.com/screenshot.png\n/usr/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/tools/index.md:300:- `screenshot` (returns image block + `MEDIA:<path>`)\n/usr/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/tools/index.md:338:- `snapshot` (returns image block + `MEDIA:<path>`)\n/usr/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/tools/index.md:365:- Images return image blocks + `MEDIA:<path>`.\n/usr/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/tools/browser.md:530:  - `--labels` adds a viewport-only screenshot with overlayed ref labels (prints `MEDIA:<path>`).\n/usr/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/tools/agent-send.md:24:  - default: prints reply text (plus `MEDIA:<url>` lines)\n/usr/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/start/openclaw.md:218:来自智能体的出站附件：在单独一行包含 `MEDIA:<path-or-url>`（无空格）。示例：\n/usr/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/start/openclaw.md:222:MEDIA:https://example.com/screenshot.png\n/usr/lib/node_modules/openclaw/docs/zh-CN/tools/index.md:275:- `screenshot`（返回图像块 + `MEDIA:<path>`）","cwd":"/home/yankeeting/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1773422861499}}
{"type":"message","id":"75dc4905","parentId":"9ca53a5a","timestamp":"2026-03-13T17:27:48.511Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"找到了！官方文档确认正确的格式是 `MEDIA:<path-or-url>`。\n\n让我查看一下飞书插件的具体实现，看看是否有特殊处理："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"exec:29","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"find /usr/lib/node_modules/openclaw -type f -name \"*.md\" 2>/dev/null | xargs grep -l \"feishu.*file\\|file.*feishu\\|飞书.*文件\" 2>/dev/null | head -5"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volces-com","model":"ark-code-latest","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773422861500}}
{"type":"message","id":"098b52a9","parentId":"75dc4905","timestamp":"2026-03-13T17:27:48.719Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"exec:29","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"/usr/lib/node_modules/openclaw/CHANGELOG.md\n/usr/lib/node_modules/openclaw/extensions/feishu/skills/feishu-perm/SKILL.md"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":204,"aggregated":"/usr/lib/node_modules/openclaw/CHANGELOG.md\n/usr/lib/node_modules/openclaw/extensions/feishu/skills/feishu-perm/SKILL.md","cwd":"/home/yankeeting/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1773422868716}}
