{"type":"message","id":"61ccdd9c","parentId":"895e08b3","timestamp":"2026-03-13T17:31:45.096Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"read:52","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"                      p.file_path,\n                      p.parent_block_id,\n                      p.filename,\n                      p.index,\n                      p.image, // data URI or plain base64\n                    ),\n                  );\n                case \"upload_file\":\n                  return json(\n                    await uploadFileBlock(\n                      client,\n                      p.doc_token,\n                      getMediaMaxBytes(p, defaultAccountId),\n                      p.url,\n                      p.file_path,\n                      p.parent_block_id,\n                      p.filename,\n                    ),\n                  );\n                case \"color_text\":\n                  return json(await updateColorText(client, p.doc_token, p.block_id, p.content));\n                case \"insert_table_row\":\n                  return json(await insertTableRow(client, p.doc_token, p.block_id, p.row_index));\n                case \"insert_table_column\":\n                  return json(\n                    await insertTableColumn(client, p.doc_token, p.block_id, p.column_index),\n                  );\n                case \"delete_table_rows\":\n                  return json(\n                    await deleteTableRows(\n                      client,\n                      p.doc_token,\n                      p.block_id,\n                      p.row_start,\n                      p.row_count,\n                    ),\n                  );\n                case \"delete_table_columns\":\n                  return json(\n                    await deleteTableColumns(\n                      client,\n                      p.doc_token,\n                      p.block_id,\n                      p.column_start,\n                      p.column_count,\n                    ),\n                  );\n                case \"merge_table_cells\":\n                  return json(\n                    await mergeTableCells(\n                      client,\n                      p.doc_token,\n                      p.block_id,\n                      p.row_start,\n                      p.row_end,\n                      p.column_start,\n                      p.column_end,\n                    ),\n                  );\n                default:\n                  // eslint-disable-next-line @typescript-eslint/no-explicit-any -- exhaustive check fallback\n                  return json({ error: `Unknown action: ${(p as any).action}` });\n              }\n            } catch (err) {\n              return json({ error: err instanceof Error ? err.message : String(err) });\n            }\n          },\n        };\n      },\n      { name: \"feishu_doc\" },\n    );\n    registered.push(\"feishu_doc\");\n  }\n\n  // Keep feishu_app_scopes as independent tool\n  if (toolsCfg.scopes) {\n    api.registerTool(\n      (ctx) => ({\n        name: \"feishu_app_scopes\",\n        label: \"Feishu App Scopes\",\n        description:\n          \"List current app permissions (scopes). Use to debug permission issues or check available capabilities.\",\n        parameters: Type.Object({}),\n        async execute() {\n          try {\n            const result = await listAppScopes(getClient(undefined, ctx.agentAccountId));\n            return json(result);\n          } catch (err) {\n            return json({ error: err instanceof Error ? err.message : String(err) });\n          }\n        },\n      }),\n      { name: \"feishu_app_scopes\" },\n    );\n    registered.push(\"feishu_app_scopes\");\n  }\n\n  if (registered.length > 0) {\n    api.logger.info?.(`feishu_doc: Registered ${registered.join(\", \")}`);\n  }\n\n[2 more lines in file. Use offset=1460 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773423105091}}
{"type":"message","id":"7a1a613c","parentId":"61ccdd9c","timestamp":"2026-03-13T17:32:05.395Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"我现在看到了完整的飞书文档操作工具！`feishu_doc` 工具支持 `upload_file` 操作。\n\n但是，我发现这个工具是用来上传到飞书文档（Doc）的，而不是直接发送文件消息到聊天中。\n\n让我查看一下直接发送文件消息的方式。根据飞书的 API，发送文件消息需要使用 `im.message.create` API，并且：\n- `msg_type`: `\"file\"`\n- `content`: `{\"file_key\":\"...\",\"file_name\":\"...\"}`\n\n问题是，要获取 `file_key`，需要先上传文件到飞书。这通常通过 `im.file.create` API 完成。\n\n让我查看一下是否有更简单的方式：\n\n根据你之前成功发送的文件消息：\n```json\n{\"file_key\":\"file_v3_00vp_639b2759-d2da-4f41-8bc9-765af0dfb24g\",\"file_name\":\"2026-03-13-%E6%97%A5%E6%8A%A5.txt\"}\n```\n\n这说明飞书的文件消息格式就是简单的 JSON，包含 `file_key` 和 `file_name`。\n\n**但是**，作为 AI agent，我无法直接获取 `file_key`，因为这需要：\n1. 调用飞书 API 上传文件\n2. 获取返回的 `file_key`\n3. 构建消息发送\n\n我没有直接调用飞书 API 的权限或工具。\n\n---\n\n**结论：**\n\n正确的飞书文件消息格式是：\n```json\n{\"file_key\":\"file_v3_xxx\",\"file_name\":\"filename.txt\"}\n```\n\n但我作为 agent 无法获取 `file_key`，所以不能直接发送文件消息给你。\n\n---\n\n**建议：**\n\n1. **使用其他方式发送文件**：如 SCP、邮件、云盘链接等\n2. **配置文件上传工具**：如果需要我经常发送文件，可以配置一个工具让我能上传文件到飞书并获取 `file_key`\n\n---\n\n需要我帮你配置文件上传功能，或者使用其他方式发送文件吗？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volces-com","model":"ark-code-latest","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773423105095}}
