{"type":"message","id":"73534a8f","parentId":"92620c55","timestamp":"2026-03-13T17:38:16.137Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"read:65","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# 修复飞书中文文件名乱码\n\n## 问题原因\n`form-data` 库把中文文件名直接放入 HTTP 头的双引号中，导致编码问题。\n\n## 修复方法：使用临时文件（推荐）\n\n### 步骤 1：编辑文件\n```bash\nsudo nano /usr/lib/node_modules/openclaw/extensions/feishu/src/media.ts\n```\n\n### 步骤 2：添加临时文件导入\n在文件顶部添加：\n```typescript\nimport { tmpdir } from \"os\";\nimport { join, extname } from \"path\";\nimport { copyFile, unlink, writeFile } from \"fs/promises\";\nimport { randomBytes } from \"crypto\";\n```\n\n### 步骤 3：修改 `sanitizeFileNameForUpload` 函数\n找到这个函数（约第 227 行），替换为：\n```typescript\n/**\n * 修复中文文件名乱码问题\n * 策略：保留原始文件名，实际修复在 uploadFileFeishu 中通过临时文件实现\n */\nexport function sanitizeFileNameForUpload(fileName: string): string {\n  // 不再进行 encodeURIComponent，直接返回原始文件名\n  return fileName;\n}\n```\n\n### 步骤 4：添加临时文件辅助函数\n在 `sanitizeFileNameForUpload` 函数后添加：\n```typescript\n/**\n * 创建临时英文文件名\n */\nfunction createTempFilePath(originalFileName: string): string {\n  const ext = extname(originalFileName) || '.bin';\n  const randomSuffix = randomBytes(8).toString('hex');\n  const tempName = `feishu_${randomSuffix}${ext}`;\n  return join(tmpdir(), tempName);\n}\n```\n\n### 步骤 5：修改 `uploadFileFeishu` 函数\n找到 `uploadFileFeishu` 函数（约第 250 行），替换整个函数为：\n```typescript\n/**\n * Upload a file to Feishu and get a file_key for sending.\n * Max file size: 30MB\n * \n * 修复：使用临时文件解决中文文件名乱码问题\n */\nexport async function uploadFileFeishu(params: {\n  cfg: ClawdbotConfig;\n  file: Buffer | string;\n  fileName: string;\n  fileType: \"opus\" | \"mp4\" | \"pdf\" | \"doc\" | \"xls\" | \"ppt\" | \"stream\";\n  duration?: number;\n  accountId?: string;\n}): Promise<UploadFileResult> {\n  const { cfg, file, fileName, fileType, duration, accountId } = params;\n  \n  // 检查是否需要临时文件修复\n  const ASCII_ONLY = /^[\\x00-\\x7F]+$/;\n  const needsTempFile = !ASCII_ONLY.test(fileName);\n  \n  if (needsTempFile) {\n    // 中文文件名，使用临时文件修复\n    const tempPath = createTempFilePath(fileName);\n    \n    try {\n      // 复制文件到临时位置（使用英文文件名）\n      if (typeof file === \"string\") {\n        await copyFile(file, tempPath);\n      } else {\n        await writeFile(tempPath, file);\n      }\n      \n      // 使用临时文件上传，但保留原始中文文件名作为显示名\n      return await uploadFileFeishuInternal({\n        cfg,\n        file: tempPath,\n        fileName,  // 原始中文文件名，用户会看到这个\n        fileType,\n        duration,\n        accountId\n      });\n    } finally {\n      // 清理临时文件\n      await unlink(tempPath).catch(() => {});\n    }\n  }\n  \n  // ASCII 文件名，直接上传\n  return uploadFileFeishuInternal({ cfg, file, fileName, fileType, duration, accountId });\n}\n\n/**\n * 内部实现：实际执行文件上传\n */\nasync function uploadFileFeishuInternal(params: {\n  cfg: ClawdbotConfig;\n  file: Buffer | string;\n  fileName: string;\n  fileType: \"opus\" | \"mp4\" | \"pdf\" | \"doc\" | \"xls\" | \"ppt\" | \"stream\";\n  duration?: number;\n  accountId?: string;\n}): Promise<UploadFileResult> {\n  const { cfg, file, fileName, fileType, duration, accountId } = params;\n  \n  const account = resolveFeishuAccount({ cfg, accountId });\n  if (!account.configured) {\n    throw new Error(`Feishu account \"${account.accountId}\" not configured`);\n  }\n\n  const client = createFeishuClient({\n    ...account,\n    httpTimeoutMs: FEISHU_MEDIA_HTTP_TIMEOUT_MS,\n  });\n\n  const fileData = typeof file === \"string\" ? fs.createReadStream(file) : file;\n  \n  // 不再对文件名进行编码，直接传递原始文件名\n  const safeFileName = fileName;\n\n  const response = await client.im.file.create({\n    data: {\n      file_type: fileType,\n      file_name: safeFileName,\n      file: fileData as any,\n      ...(duration !== undefined && { duration }),\n    },\n  });\n\n  const responseAny = response as any;\n  if (responseAny.code !== undefined && responseAny.code !== 0) {\n    throw new Error(`Feishu file upload failed: ${responseAny.msg || `code ${responseAny.code}`}`);\n  }\n\n  const fileKey = responseAny.file_key ?? responseAny.data?.file_key;\n  if (!fileKey) {\n    throw new Error(\"Feishu file upload failed: no file_key returned\");\n  }\n\n  return { fileKey };\n}\n```\n\n### 步骤 6：重启 OpenClaw\n```bash\nopenclaw gateway restart\n```\n\n## 测试\n\n发送一个中文文件测试：\n```bash\nopenclaw message send --channel feishu --target \"<user_id>\" --media /path/to/中文文件名.txt\n```\n\n文件名应该正确显示为中文，而不是 `%E6%97%A5`。\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773423496132}}
{"type":"message","id":"b66b1e0f","parentId":"73534a8f","timestamp":"2026-03-13T17:38:28.755Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"我看到了这个修复文档，但它主要是关于修复中文文件名乱码的问题，并没有告诉我如何正确发送文件消息。\n\n让我回到问题的核心。根据之前的所有研究：\n\n1. **你成功发送的文件消息格式是**：\n```json\n{\"file_key\":\"file_v3_00vp_639b2759-d2da-4f41-8bc9-765af0dfb24g\",\"file_name\":\"2026-03-13-%E6%97%A5%E6%8A%A5.txt\"}\n```\n\n2. **关键问题**：`file_key` 必须通过飞书 API 上传文件才能获取，我无法直接生成。\n\n3. **我之前的尝试**：\n- `MEDIA:` 格式 ❌\n- 相对路径 ❌\n- 绝对路径 ❌\n- JSON 格式 ❌\n\n**我想直接问你**：正确的发送方式是什么？我之前的研究方向是不是完全错了？\n\n根据系统提示说的 \"prefer the message tool (media/path/filePath)\"，是不是应该使用某种工具调用，而不是在文本中嵌入路径？\n\n如果你能给我一点提示，我就能更快地学会这个技能。🦞"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volces-com","model":"ark-code-latest","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773423496136}}
