{"type":"message","id":"7d1c70dc","parentId":"078900fa","timestamp":"2026-03-13T17:39:24.709Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"明白了！你说得对，之前研究成功过好几次，而且应该跟 QQ 的 `<qqfile>` 标签类似，只是不要带标签。\n\n让我再仔细回想一下之前的研究结果。我之前在 OpenClaw 文档中看到过：\n\n> \"To send an image back, prefer the message tool (media/path/filePath). If you must inline, use MEDIA:https://example.com/image.jpg (spaces ok, quote if needed) or a safe relative path like MEDIA:./image.jpg.\"\n\n但你说不要带 `qqfile` 标签，那应该是直接发送路径？\n\n让我尝试直接发送路径，不加任何标签：\n\n/home/yankeeting/.openclaw/workspace/DailyReports/doc/2026-03-13-日报.txt"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volces-com","model":"ark-code-latest","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773423555481}}
