{"type":"message","id":"3df181a3","parentId":"b3a3b562","timestamp":"2026-03-13T17:50:39.062Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\n都是typescript的文件，没有密码。用户说密码在临时记忆里，可能我之前的会话有？或者可能我记错了？或者用户是想让我直接尝试修复？\n或者我试试用exec来修改文件，用sudo -S来输入密码？不过我不知道密码。或者我试试问用户密码？不过用户说在临时记忆里。\n或者我先把需要修复的代码写出来，然后告诉用户需要sudo密码才能修改？\n不对，用户说密码在临时记忆中，让我再想想。哦，可能我之前的对话里有？让我想想，不对，我没有之前的记忆。或者可能密码是默认的？比如123456？或者root？或者和用户的密码一样？\n或者我试试不用密码？不行，刚才执行sudo要密码。\n或者我先写好修复的步骤和代码，让用户自己执行？\n对，我可以先写出需要修复的代码，然后告诉用户需要用sudo权限来修改。\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"我没有找到sudo密码。不过我可以给你写出修复这个bug需要的代码，你可以手动修复：\n\n### 修复步骤：\n\n1. **编辑 `/usr/lib/node_modules/openclaw/extensions/feishu/src/media.ts` 文件**\n\n2. **在文件头部添加导入**：\n```typescript\nimport { sendMessageFeishu } from \"./send.js\";\n```\n\n3. **在文件末尾添加 `sendMediaFeishu` 函数**：\n```typescript\n/**\n * Upload and send a media file to a Feishu chat\n * @param cfg OpenClaw config\n * @param to Send target (open_id/chat_id)\n * @param mediaUrl Local file path or remote URL\n * @param accountId Feishu account id\n * @param mediaLocalRoots Allowed local media roots\n * @param replyToMessageId Optional reply to message id\n * @returns Send result\n */\nexport async function sendMediaFeishu(params: {\n  cfg: ClawdbotConfig;\n  to: string;\n  mediaUrl: string;\n  accountId?: string;\n  mediaLocalRoots?: string[];\n  replyToMessageId?: string;\n}): Promise<SendResult> {\n  const { cfg, to, mediaUrl, accountId, replyToMessageId } = params;\n  \n  // Determine file type\n  const ext = path.extname(mediaUrl).toLowerCase();\n  let fileType: \"opus\" | \"mp4\" | \"pdf\" | \"doc\" | \"xls\" | \"ppt\" | \"stream\" = \"stream\";\n  \n  if ([\".pdf\"].includes(ext)) fileType = \"pdf\";\n  else if ([\".doc\", \".docx\", \".txt\", \".md\"].includes(ext)) fileType = \"doc\";\n  else if ([\".xls\", \".xlsx\", \".csv\"].includes(ext)) fileType = \"xls\";\n  else if ([\".ppt\", \".pptx\"].includes(ext)) fileType = \"ppt\";\n  else if ([\".mp4\", \".mov\", \".avi\"].includes(ext)) fileType = \"mp4\";\n  else if ([\".mp3\", \".opus\", \".wav\"].includes(ext)) fileType = \"opus\";\n  \n  // Upload file\n  const { fileKey } = await uploadFileFeishu({\n    cfg,\n    file: mediaUrl,\n    fileName: path.basename(mediaUrl),\n    fileType,\n    accountId,\n  });\n  \n  // Send file message\n  const content = JSON.stringify({\n    file_key: fileKey,\n    file_name: path.basename(mediaUrl)\n  });\n  \n  return await sendMessageFeishu({\n    cfg,\n    to,\n    content,\n    msgType: \"file\",\n    accountId,\n    replyToMessageId,\n  });\n}\n```\n\n4. **重启 OpenClaw 网关**：\n```bash\nopenclaw gateway restart\n```\n\n修复完成后，就可以正常使用 `openclaw message send --media` 命令发送文件了，我也可以直接发送文件给你了。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volces-com","model":"ark-code-latest","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773424217079}}
