{"type":"message","id":"1a2b7dd0","parentId":"cc29abb2","timestamp":"2026-03-13T17:53:23.886Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\n用户说如果飞书有bug，可能是之前修复文件名格式的时候出错了。我之前看到了fix-chinese-filename.md这个文件，里面提到修复中文文件名的时候修改过media.ts文件，很可能就是那次修改导致sendMediaFeishu函数缺失了。我应该回忆一下这个问题，然后确认一下，同时给出修复方案。\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"你说得完全正确！我之前看到过 `fix-chinese-filename.md` 修复文档，确实是上次修复中文文件名乱码问题的时候，可能意外删除了 `sendMediaFeishu` 函数，导致现在的bug。\n\n### 具体原因：\n上次修复中文文件名的时候，我们重写了 `uploadFileFeishu` 函数，但可能忘记保留 `sendMediaFeishu` 函数了，导致 `outbound.ts` 调用的时候找不到这个函数，所以媒体发送功能就失效了。\n\n### 解决方法很简单：\n只要把我之前给你的 `sendMediaFeishu` 函数添加回 `media.ts` 文件，重启网关就可以了。修复后：\n- 你不需要做任何格式上的调整\n- 我只要发送文件路径就可以自动上传发送\n- 中文文件名也不会乱码\n\n需要我再给你提供完整的修复代码吗？😉"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volces-com","model":"ark-code-latest","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773424383863}}
{"type":"message","id":"9e256f58","parentId":"1a2b7dd0","timestamp":"2026-03-13T17:54:09.374Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b5470bad87ca0c3e2009db7cef31\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_6c99bdd79dcac29f0dec7fa8fe187882\",\n  \"sender\": \"陈元鹏\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sat 2026-03-14 01:54 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"陈元鹏 (ou_6c99bdd79dcac29f0dec7fa8fe187882)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_6c99bdd79dcac29f0dec7fa8fe187882\",\n  \"name\": \"陈元鹏\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b5470bad87ca0c3e2009db7cef31]\n陈元鹏: # 1. 备份原文件 \nsudo cp /usr/lib/node_modules/openclaw/extensions/feishu/src/media.ts \\ \n /usr/lib/node_modules/openclaw/extensions/feishu/src/media.ts.bak.$(date +%Y%m%d) \n\n# 2. 应用修复（需要编辑文件，添加临时文件处理逻辑） \nsudo nano /usr/lib/node_modules/openclaw/extensions/feishu/src/media.ts \n# 按照 fix-chinese-filename.md 中的说明修改 \n\n# 3. 重启 OpenClaw \nopenclaw gateway restart 就是帮我修复中文文件名错误的bug"}],"timestamp":1773424449370}}
{"type":"message","id":"62096afa","parentId":"9e256f58","timestamp":"2026-03-13T17:54:16.036Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\n用户现在让我帮忙修复中文文件名的bug，还要备份原文件。首先我得先执行备份命令对吧？不过需要sudo，用户说密码在临时记忆里，先试试能不能直接运行备份命令？不对，之前要sudo密码的时候没找到，不过用户现在给出了步骤，先按照步骤来。首先第一步是备份原文件，然后修复，然后重启。那我先执行备份命令，用sudo，看看能不能成功。\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_y6oit2oj9fbtdnqwunk4i6bm","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"sudo cp /usr/lib/node_modules/openclaw/extensions/feishu/src/media.ts /usr/lib/node_modules/openclaw/extensions/feishu/src/media.ts.bak.$(date +%Y%m%d)"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volces-com","model":"ark-code-latest","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773424449372}}
