{"type":"message","id":"e692a885","parentId":"d52c2a47","timestamp":"2026-03-13T17:54:56.599Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\n用户说有备份，我看到了，有一个备份文件 media.ts.bak.20260314_004759，比当前的文件大，应该包含缺失的 sendMediaFeishu 函数。让我查看备份文件的内容，看看里面有没有这个函数，这样就不用自己写了，直接还原就行。\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"太好了！有备份文件！`media.ts.bak.20260314_004759` 比当前文件大，应该包含缺失的 `sendMediaFeishu` 函数。让我查看备份文件的内容：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_dej58dbbrrqvuc4qffkkf50y","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/usr/lib/node_modules/openclaw/extensions/feishu/src/media.ts.bak.20260314_004759","offset":350,"limit":150}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volces-com","model":"ark-code-latest","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773424480319}}
{"type":"message","id":"0ce42277","parentId":"e692a885","timestamp":"2026-03-13T17:54:56.610Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_dej58dbbrrqvuc4qffkkf50y","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"}): Promise<SendMediaResult> {\n  const { cfg, to, fileKey, replyToMessageId, replyInThread, accountId } = params;\n  const msgType = params.msgType ?? \"file\";\n  const { client, receiveId, receiveIdType } = resolveFeishuSendTarget({\n    cfg,\n    to,\n    accountId,\n  });\n  const content = JSON.stringify({ file_key: fileKey });\n\n  if (replyToMessageId) {\n    const response = await client.im.message.reply({\n      path: { message_id: replyToMessageId },\n      data: {\n        content,\n        msg_type: msgType,\n        ...(replyInThread ? { reply_in_thread: true } : {}),\n      },\n    });\n    assertFeishuMessageApiSuccess(response, \"Feishu file reply failed\");\n    return toFeishuSendResult(response, receiveId);\n  }\n\n  const response = await client.im.message.create({\n    params: { receive_id_type: receiveIdType },\n    data: {\n      receive_id: receiveId,\n      content,\n      msg_type: msgType,\n    },\n  });\n  assertFeishuMessageApiSuccess(response, \"Feishu file send failed\");\n  return toFeishuSendResult(response, receiveId);\n}\n\n/**\n * Helper to detect file type from extension\n */\nexport function detectFileType(\n  fileName: string,\n): \"opus\" | \"mp4\" | \"pdf\" | \"doc\" | \"xls\" | \"ppt\" | \"stream\" {\n  const ext = path.extname(fileName).toLowerCase();\n  switch (ext) {\n    case \".opus\":\n    case \".ogg\":\n      return \"opus\";\n    case \".mp4\":\n    case \".mov\":\n    case \".avi\":\n      return \"mp4\";\n    case \".pdf\":\n      return \"pdf\";\n    case \".doc\":\n    case \".docx\":\n      return \"doc\";\n    case \".xls\":\n    case \".xlsx\":\n      return \"xls\";\n    case \".ppt\":\n    case \".pptx\":\n      return \"ppt\";\n    default:\n      return \"stream\";\n  }\n}\n\n/**\n * Upload and send media (image or file) from URL, local path, or buffer.\n * When mediaUrl is a local path, mediaLocalRoots (from core outbound context)\n * must be passed so loadWebMedia allows the path (post CVE-2026-26321).\n */\nexport async function sendMediaFeishu(params: {\n  cfg: ClawdbotConfig;\n  to: string;\n  mediaUrl?: string;\n  mediaBuffer?: Buffer;\n  fileName?: string;\n  replyToMessageId?: string;\n  replyInThread?: boolean;\n  accountId?: string;\n  /** Allowed roots for local path reads; required for local filePath to work. */\n  mediaLocalRoots?: readonly string[];\n}): Promise<SendMediaResult> {\n  const {\n    cfg,\n    to,\n    mediaUrl,\n    mediaBuffer,\n    fileName,\n    replyToMessageId,\n    replyInThread,\n    accountId,\n    mediaLocalRoots,\n  } = params;\n  const account = resolveFeishuAccount({ cfg, accountId });\n  if (!account.configured) {\n    throw new Error(`Feishu account \"${account.accountId}\" not configured`);\n  }\n  const mediaMaxBytes = (account.config?.mediaMaxMb ?? 30) * 1024 * 1024;\n\n  let buffer: Buffer;\n  let name: string;\n\n  if (mediaBuffer) {\n    buffer = mediaBuffer;\n    name = fileName ?? \"file\";\n  } else if (mediaUrl) {\n    const loaded = await getFeishuRuntime().media.loadWebMedia(mediaUrl, {\n      maxBytes: mediaMaxBytes,\n      optimizeImages: false,\n      localRoots: mediaLocalRoots?.length ? mediaLocalRoots : undefined,\n    });\n    buffer = loaded.buffer;\n    name = fileName ?? loaded.fileName ?? \"file\";\n  } else {\n    throw new Error(\"Either mediaUrl or mediaBuffer must be provided\");\n  }\n\n  // Determine if it's an image based on extension\n  const ext = path.extname(name).toLowerCase();\n  const isImage = [\".jpg\", \".jpeg\", \".png\", \".gif\", \".webp\", \".bmp\", \".ico\", \".tiff\"].includes(ext);\n\n  if (isImage) {\n    const { imageKey } = await uploadImageFeishu({ cfg, image: buffer, accountId });\n    return sendImageFeishu({ cfg, to, imageKey, replyToMessageId, replyInThread, accountId });\n  } else {\n    const fileType = detectFileType(name);\n    const { fileKey } = await uploadFileFeishu({\n      cfg,\n      file: buffer,\n      fileName: name,\n      fileType,\n      accountId,\n    });\n    // Feishu API: opus -> \"audio\", mp4/video -> \"media\" (playable), others -> \"file\"\n    const msgType = fileType === \"opus\" ? \"audio\" : fileType === \"mp4\" ? \"media\" : \"file\";\n    return sendFileFeishu({\n      cfg,\n      to,\n      fileKey,\n      msgType,\n      replyToMessageId,\n      replyInThread,\n      accountId,\n    });\n  }\n}\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773424496603}}
{"type":"message","id":"5a71c6e2","parentId":"0ce42277","timestamp":"2026-03-13T17:55:14.578Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\n用户之前说原来的修复步骤有备份，我现在找到了备份文件，里面确实有缺失的 `sendMediaFeishu` 函数。\n现在我需要：\n1. 首先恢复备份文件，这样就能把缺失的函数补回来\n2. 然后再应用中文文件名的修复，这样既不会丢失函数，又能解决中文文件名乱码问题\n\n首先我需要sudo权限来恢复备份，但是之前提示需要密码。不过用户之前说过sudo密码应该在临时记忆中，但是我没找到。不过可能用户希望我直接用备份文件覆盖当前文件？或者我可以提示用户恢复备份。\n\n不过我先尝试用sudo cp命令恢复备份，可能用户已经配置了无密码sudo？或者等下用户会给我密码。\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"太好了！备份文件里确实有完整的 `sendMediaFeishu` 函数！就是上次修复中文文件名的时候，我们不小心覆盖了整个文件，把这个函数弄丢了。\n\n现在只需要两步就能修复：\n1. **恢复备份文件**：把备份文件恢复回来，就能找回缺失的 `sendMediaFeishu` 函数\n2. **重新应用中文文件名修复**：在恢复后的文件上重新应用中文文件名的修复，不会再丢失函数\n\n我现在执行恢复操作：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_l2a78213x2c24d9kp1t55e7h","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"sudo cp /usr/lib/node_modules/openclaw/extensions/feishu/src/media.ts.bak.20260314_004759 /usr/lib/node_modules/openclaw/extensions/feishu/src/media.ts"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volces-com","model":"ark-code-latest","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773424496609}}
