{"type":"message","id":"a360ef78","parentId":"f4220983","timestamp":"2026-03-13T18:01:49.860Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\n用户说还是不对，而且怀疑和之前修复中文文件名乱码有关系。首先我需要确认：之前恢复备份文件的时候，是不是把中文文件名的修复覆盖掉了？因为备份文件是修复之前的版本，所以中文文件名的修复应该丢失了，需要重新应用。\n\n首先我要重新应用fix-chinese-filename.md里的修复，确保中文文件名不会乱码，同时保留sendMediaFeishu函数。\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"你说得对！我刚才恢复的备份文件是修复中文文件名之前的版本，所以中文文件名的修复丢失了。我现在重新应用中文文件名的修复：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_q2drabept5fprhvirfcauos7","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/yankeeting/.openclaw/workspace/fix-chinese-filename.md","limit":100}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volces-com","model":"ark-code-latest","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773424900936}}
{"type":"message","id":"23194610","parentId":"a360ef78","timestamp":"2026-03-13T18:01:49.873Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_q2drabept5fprhvirfcauos7","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# 修复飞书中文文件名乱码\n\n## 问题原因\n`form-data` 库把中文文件名直接放入 HTTP 头的双引号中，导致编码问题。\n\n## 修复方法：使用临时文件（推荐）\n\n### 步骤 1：编辑文件\n```bash\nsudo nano /usr/lib/node_modules/openclaw/extensions/feishu/src/media.ts\n```\n\n### 步骤 2：添加临时文件导入\n在文件顶部添加：\n```typescript\nimport { tmpdir } from \"os\";\nimport { join, extname } from \"path\";\nimport { copyFile, unlink, writeFile } from \"fs/promises\";\nimport { randomBytes } from \"crypto\";\n```\n\n### 步骤 3：修改 `sanitizeFileNameForUpload` 函数\n找到这个函数（约第 227 行），替换为：\n```typescript\n/**\n * 修复中文文件名乱码问题\n * 策略：保留原始文件名，实际修复在 uploadFileFeishu 中通过临时文件实现\n */\nexport function sanitizeFileNameForUpload(fileName: string): string {\n  // 不再进行 encodeURIComponent，直接返回原始文件名\n  return fileName;\n}\n```\n\n### 步骤 4：添加临时文件辅助函数\n在 `sanitizeFileNameForUpload` 函数后添加：\n```typescript\n/**\n * 创建临时英文文件名\n */\nfunction createTempFilePath(originalFileName: string): string {\n  const ext = extname(originalFileName) || '.bin';\n  const randomSuffix = randomBytes(8).toString('hex');\n  const tempName = `feishu_${randomSuffix}${ext}`;\n  return join(tmpdir(), tempName);\n}\n```\n\n### 步骤 5：修改 `uploadFileFeishu` 函数\n找到 `uploadFileFeishu` 函数（约第 250 行），替换整个函数为：\n```typescript\n/**\n * Upload a file to Feishu and get a file_key for sending.\n * Max file size: 30MB\n * \n * 修复：使用临时文件解决中文文件名乱码问题\n */\nexport async function uploadFileFeishu(params: {\n  cfg: ClawdbotConfig;\n  file: Buffer | string;\n  fileName: string;\n  fileType: \"opus\" | \"mp4\" | \"pdf\" | \"doc\" | \"xls\" | \"ppt\" | \"stream\";\n  duration?: number;\n  accountId?: string;\n}): Promise<UploadFileResult> {\n  const { cfg, file, fileName, fileType, duration, accountId } = params;\n  \n  // 检查是否需要临时文件修复\n  const ASCII_ONLY = /^[\\x00-\\x7F]+$/;\n  const needsTempFile = !ASCII_ONLY.test(fileName);\n  \n  if (needsTempFile) {\n    // 中文文件名，使用临时文件修复\n    const tempPath = createTempFilePath(fileName);\n    \n    try {\n      // 复制文件到临时位置（使用英文文件名）\n      if (typeof file === \"string\") {\n        await copyFile(file, tempPath);\n      } else {\n        await writeFile(tempPath, file);\n      }\n      \n      // 使用临时文件上传，但保留原始中文文件名作为显示名\n      return await uploadFileFeishuInternal({\n        cfg,\n        file: tempPath,\n        fileName,  // 原始中文文件名，用户会看到这个\n        fileType,\n        duration,\n        accountId\n      });\n    } finally {\n      // 清理临时文件\n      await unlink(tempPath).catch(() => {});\n    }\n  }\n  \n  // ASCII 文件名，直接上传\n  return uploadFileFeishuInternal({ cfg, file, fileName, fileType, duration, accountId });\n\n[67 more lines in file. Use offset=101 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773424909867}}
