{"type":"message","id":"43eb2c8c","parentId":"aa012763","timestamp":"2026-03-13T18:13:26.065Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\n用户让我把判断文件是否发送成功的方式也写入到刚才创建的skill里面，我需要修改skill文件，把这部分内容加进去。首先要读取现有的skill文件内容，然后在合适的位置添加判断发送成功的部分。\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_q9noh0ptzl81rlncwas2cj9w","name":"edit","arguments":{"path":"/home/yankeeting/.openclaw/workspace/skills/feishu-file-sender/SKILL.md","old_string":"## 验证标准\n命令执行后返回 `✅ Sent via Feishu. Message ID: xxx` 即为发送成功","new_string":"## 验证标准\n### 发送成功判断\n1. **命令返回验证**：执行命令后返回 `✅ Sent via Feishu. Message ID: xxx` 即为发送成功\n2. **日志验证**：网关日志中出现 `dispatch complete (queuedFinal=true)` 且无错误记录\n3. **错误判断**：如果出现 `sendMediaFeishu failed`、`path-not-allowed`、权限错误等记录，即为发送失败\n\n### 注意\n只能确认我方发送成功，无法100%确认用户侧收到（可能存在网络/飞书延迟）。如果发送失败，自动重试最多2次，重试失败则告知用户具体错误原因。"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volces-com","model":"ark-code-latest","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773425583049}}
